                                "sense_id": "ef9e7e7e-04a8-3a91-87e7-5d72b1ccc24e",
                                "text": "The medication can constipate you if you’re not drinking enough water."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bdc3d6d9-2f9f-4999-98eb-d5d0db68422d",
                                "sense_id": "ef9e7e7e-04a8-3a91-87e7-5d72b1ccc24e",
                                "text": "The long hours of travel seemed to constipate his digestion."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba69bb1c-4f72-444e-8981-26daf7b6e275",
                                "sense_id": "ef9e7e7e-04a8-3a91-87e7-5d72b1ccc24e",
                                "text": "A lack of fiber can constipate the body, leading to discomfort."
                            }
                        ]
